Zork I: The Great Underground Empire
=====================================

This directory contains a compiled Z-machine story file for Zork I,
included with SklaffKOM so that the Adventure feature can be used
immediately after installation.

File:
    zork1.z3 

Zork I was originally written by Marc Blank, Dave Lebling,
Bruce Daniels and Tim Anderson and published by Infocom.

Source
------

This story file was built from the ZIL source code published in:

    historicalsource/zork1

Source commit:

    97b7b3d68c075dd9af7da499c3e9690ada3471fd

The source code is distributed under the MIT License.

The corresponding license is included with SklaffKOM as:

    LICENSE.zork1

Build
-----

The included zork1.z3 was compiled from the ZIL sources using ZILF 1.9
and ZAPF 1.9 on October 14, 2026.

SHA-256:

    fcfa34f0f244362b6e7f1bf7365463ec558100aa8574f19b2bda2cbfb6bedcd3

The generated story file has been tested with the Frotz interpreter
bundled with SklaffKOM.

SklaffKOM does not modify the Zork I game itself. The compiled story
file is included solely as a ready-to-play game for the Adventure
feature.

